  "notes": "TCL Smart TV Pro (G08, G08_4K_GB, MediaTek), Europe/UK firmware, Android 12\nModel \"Smart TV Pro\", device G08, fingerprint TCL/G08_4K_GB/G08:12/STT2.221228.001/AS34:user/release-keys.\nSame G08 board family as the C755/QM6K/85RM7L/US lists, but this is the older Android 12 EU firmware:\nno Samba-ACR ttvs build, no AirplayAPK, no hotelmenu/channelplus/e-sticker/TV+/usercenter, no Android 14\nad services. The US list (examples/tcl-g08-us-google-tv) applies only partially here; this list is the\nsubset that exists on this build, applied by hand with `pm disable-user --user 0`.\n\nTested 21 October 2026 on one set. All 24 packages below are disabled on that set and it boots, plays\nHDMI/Live TV and opens the source menu normally.\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/tcl-g08-eu-android12/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/tcl-g08-eu-android12/debloat.txt\nEverything is DISABLED, not uninstalled. Comment out any line you want to keep.\n\nStock launcher: com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx (left enabled here, no custom launcher installed\non this set). Live TV / HDMI app: com.tcl.tv. Left enabled on purpose: com.tcl.tv, com.tcl.tvinput,\ncom.tcl.globalkeyoverlay, com.tcl.tv.tclhome_passive, com.google.android.katniss (voice), Play Services,\ncom.dolby.*; the three packages marked DO NOT DISABLE below are load-bearing, see comments.\nTCL promo, push messages, help/demo apps and log capture",
